%%%
A written Poisson regression law Poisson.(exp.(alpha .+ x * beta)) is the §09 PoissonLogGLM. §09 requires finite coefficients, so an
infinite coefficient is outside the law's declared value set. At alpha = 800 every rate overflows: the log density is
about -8.18e347, which rounds to -inf.
%%%
flatppl_compat = "0.1"
x = elementof(cartpow(reals, [3, 2]))
alpha = elementof(reals)
beta = elementof(cartpow(reals, 2))
